0:14.63,0:00:17.54,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,Akıp giden yıllar... İnsanların hayalleri...Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:20.37,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,Bunlar durdurulamaz.Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.48,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar özgürlüğü arzuladıkça...Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.11,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,...bunlar ebediyen var olmaya devam edecek!